          "lore_md": "Dances three nights a week in a tablao that has burned down twice and never lost its license. Isabel's duende is literal: mortals who watch her perform wake with bruised throats and missing evenings. She polices Seville's Elysium with a duena's fury and has never needed the sheriff. Fictional-registry entry (plausible canon-adjacent).",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_toreador14.png"
