          "threat": "low",
          "lore_md": "Spray-can cartography: Lucia tags the city's shadows to track kindred traffic the way airlines track flights. Her murals are signals only other degenerates can read — and now one more node can, because she trades copies to SchreckNET in exchange for being left alone. Fictional-registry entry (plausible canon-adjacent).",
