          "location": {
            "city": "unknown",
            "place": "unconfirmed venue"
          },
          "threat": "high",
          "lore_md": "A voice in every Siren recording that none of the singers admit to. Audio forensics place it beneath the lowest register of any choir in the registry. When the Bellows joins a track, every other Siren in the region goes silent within a night. Directive: if two files in the same week carry the second voice, suspend choir transcription and route everything to quarantine. FLAG: SECOND-VOICE. We do not know what it breathes for. Stop asking the singers.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_doc18.png"
