          "lore_md": "Counts fifteen skulls in a locked niche the registry has logged as fourteen since 1444. She re-counts on every visit and files the difference as a correction, never a loss. Flag COUNT-DRIFT: the missing skull has not moved in five centuries; the surplus one moves. She will not say whose it is. Operators: log the count, seal the niche, walk away.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_harbingers12.png"
