          "lore_md": "Reads strontium in teeth the way accountants read ledgers, and trades mound timestamps for corridor maps out of Jutland. TIDE-BONE: his readings arrive with the tide whether or not any sea is near. He has never been wrong about a Final Death; he has also never announced one. Ask differently and he answers in bones no one can parse.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_harbingers13.png"
