          "lore_md": "Guards a mausoleum row the cemetery maps show as open lawn. WARDEN-DEBT: he waives his fee for anyone bringing news of Cappadocius, including lies; he has waived it one thousand four hundred times. Each waiver is a data point. Do not lie to him twice. The second lie is filed as testimony, and testimony becomes a leash.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_harbingers16.png"
