          "lore_md": "Sings pitch at femur stacks and reads the echo as a casualty report. CHOIR-COUNT: the echo returns one voice more than the singers she brought, and she files the surplus under her own name to keep the registry balanced. Directive: never harmonize with the echo. Operators who tried reported the harmony continuing after they stopped humming.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_harbingers17.png"
