          "lore_md": "Reads Latin settle patterns in sealed crypt dust. DUST-LATIN: the letters rearrange between visits, always into the names of people who died within the week. He transcribes them under PENDING. Accuracy on predicted Final Deaths is seventy-one percent; accuracy on his own errors is zero. Keep his file read-only and quote it exactly.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_harbingers18.png"
