          "lore_md": "Counts candles lit for the dead and treats the surplus flames as registrations of unfiled deaths. CANDLE-SURPLUS has matched Family obituary omissions eleven times. She sells the delta, not the names. Directive: buy the delta only. Names bought from her arrive attached to the buyer by the second reading.",
