          "lore_md": "Reads ash rows from the annexe burn pit and counts stems that did not burn. ASH-TALLY: unburned stems equal unacknowledged deaths, one for one, nineteen counts running. She sells nothing. She posts the tally where operators can photograph it. Directive: photograph only. Ashes removed from the pit reappear in the pit by the next moon.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_harbingers34.png"
