          "lore_md": "Counts thresholds within a fifty-mile radius from the tomb chamber. Flag THRESHOLD-RISING: the count has risen every year since 1999. Not doors. Thresholds: the lines a building draws between inside and outside. She says the land is drawing more lines to keep something compartmented. The count is her only filing. It is enough.",
