          "lore_md": "Meta entry. A steel tape found in the Berlin ruins reads the exact distance to the burned Vienna chantry of 2008, though it has not been moved since the fire. Flag TAPE-FIXED: the reading does not change when the tape is moved. Directive: do not re-measure. Two surveyors did. The tape now reads their distance from each other, and it is not zero.",
