          "threat": "mid",
          "lore_md": "Works the cold aisles before the stalls open, buying what the vendors will not admit to owning. His ledger of freezer inventory drifts eleven kilos a month in no direction any audit accepts. SchreckNET flag COLD-COUNT: compare posted stock against truck manifests; the gap is his feeding. Directive: never stand in the aisle while the lights cycle.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_nag11.png"
