          "threat": "mid",
          "lore_md": "Counts the steamer baskets. His household ledger reconciles pork, offal, and one column that appears only in cold months and never in writing. He settles debts in the third person, as if the kitchen answered him. SchreckNET flag DUMPLING-LEDGER: basket counts drop by pairs on feast days. Directive: never count the baskets where he can see you counting.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_nag14.png"
