          "lore_md": "Walks the morgue at shift change and signs the log with the watchman pen. Her shifts do not appear on any roster and yet the log is complete. She files her rounds as mercy. SchreckNET flag MORGUE-SHIFT: three signed entries per night, two watchmen on payroll. Directive: log the discrepancy, do not meet it.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_nag16.png"
