          "lore_md": "A mortal trauma surgeon Embraced mid-shift and mid-decision — she was holding a wound closed when her sire's hand shook. She finished the shift first. Esther runs a mobile clinic under the bridges, unaffiliated, and treats the blood-diseased as well as the blood-drunk. Her third eye makes cameras useless, which she calls the only modern luxury. The Tremere have tried to purchase her twice. Both envoys were treated, free of charge, for pride.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_salubri07.png"
