          "lore_md": "Healer who bills in confessions and files them as clinical notes. Refuses to heal the same patient twice: the second visit means the patient is lying about something. Flag TWO-VISIT-RULE: every repeat patient in his ledger has a second file operators are not cleared to read. His own file lists him dead since 1941. The file and the healer disagree; the healing works.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_salubri17.png"
