          "alias": "THE BITTER SHELF",
          "gen": "8th",
          "era": "saxon nights to present",
          "location": {
            "city": "Brasov",
            "place": "weavers bastion cistern annex"
          },
          "threat": "low",
          "lore_md": "Trades healer-made compounds the courts ban on principle and drink on schedule. Flag BITTER-SHELF: every sample tested returns inert and every patient returns healed. Compounds work or the shelf lies; the shelf does not lie. Fee is a settled debt, any debt, witnessed. He treats debt as the only disease worth naming and is usually right.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_salubri23.png"
