          "lore_md": "Licensed physician, licensed again after death, licensed a third time under a name the registry flags but honors. Heals in daylight buildings and walks out through the night side. Flag COAT-CLEAR: her credentials verify with three different dead registrars. Board refuses to review. Patients sign the usual forms; the usual forms list her as attending since 1968.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_salubri26.png"
