          "lore_md": "No woman has entered the Mountain in a thousand years; the Porter is entered in the monastery rolls as Brother, and the rolls are correct. Heals pilgrims who should not have found the gate. Flag ATHOS-PASS: his gate logs a visitor the Mountain denies hosting, annually, on the same night. The night is not named in the file. He sends the network one olive branch each year; it arrives before it is sent.",
