          "lore_md": "Seals every healing with wax and a mark no registry can match. Flag WAX-SEAL: seal mark appears on court documents that predate her Embrace. She says the mark was hers before the documents were, which is either a lie or a title. Patients who peel the seal early relapse; patients who keep it heal past all models. The registry keeps the peel rate and does not publish it.",
