          "threat": "mid",
          "lore_md": "Healed through four occupations without taking a side, which in this city is the local definition of a saint and the registry definition of a risk. Flag IRON-TRIAGE: casualty lists he touches sort themselves by who can be saved. He does not edit the lists; the lists edit themselves. Courts leave him one corridor each. He leaves them the corridor.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_salubri31.png"
