          "lore_md": "Runs a ward in the cistern that treats both courts and charges the Camarilla in favors and the Sabbat in silence. Flag NIGHTINGALE-CHART: patient outcomes beat every city on the network. The chart lists a consultant no registry can find. Operators requested to stop scheduling the consultant; the ward schedules itself now.",
