          "lore_md": "File compiled from fourteen healers across nine countries, each of whom reports the same patient: a wound none of them can close, carried by someone none of them can describe, waiting politely. Flag UNHEALED-DOSSIER: fourteen entries, zero overlap in description, identical handwriting. Standing directive: if a healing fails you have never seen fail, log the failure, do not reopen the file. The file reopens itself for the patient. It is patient with everyone.",
