          "lore_md": "Widow of a real embalmer; kept the business license alive for fifty years. Books in advance the funerals of people who die exactly as scheduled. Flag EMBALM-LEDGER: 41 pre-booked matches, zero errors. Cross-reference booking dates against SI sweep windows before sharing.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_sam13.png"
