          "threat": "low",
          "lore_md": "Dug her own grave twice and filed both times. Sits confession hours for the dead, not the living. Flag ORDER-OF-ROT: her decay reverses during Requiem Mass only. Cooperative with node records. If she asks who filed her, answer: the ledger, never a name.",
