          "threat": "low",
          "lore_md": "Keeps the old wake hours for kindred who want to be mourned properly before the final death. Flag WAKE-COUNT: she has mourned 61; the count in her ledger is 63. She will not say whose are missing. Do not volunteer for the next one.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_sam19.png"
