          "threat": "mid",
          "lore_md": "Filed himself as a specimen in 1902; curators keep re-shelving him. Flag SPECIMEN-ROT: his display card updates its own date. Museum inventory shows one more exhibit than the public catalogue every audit. Do not correct the inventory. The extra item is watching the counter.",
          "photo": "assets/img/char_sam20.png"
