      "weakness": "They keep the mirror-void of the clan and add a taste for authority without structure: they hold office in the Sabbat and break its rules the way other priests break fasts, routinely and without guilt.",
      "lore_md": "SchreckNET assessment: Lasombra antitribu are the clergy the Sabbat does not ordain and cannot excommunicate. They keep the clan disciplines and the clan hunger for command, but their loyalty attaches to persons, not institutions: a bishop, a mother superior, a drowned admiral. The registry tracks them as individuals because sect labels on this file are decorative.\n\nTheir obtenebration skews devotional: shadow used as sacrament, confession, veil. Their feeding runs through confessionals and baptisteries, and their childer are recruited from the faithful rather than the ambitious.\n\nThe file separates them from pure clan stock by the reflection test, the ordination pattern, and the fact that they tithe shadow rather than vitae. Treat sect designations in their paperwork as costumes.\n\nStanding directive: respect the office, doubt the allegiance. Log which bishop they answer to this season; it changes without notice, and the registry has stopped predicting it.",
