      "lore_md": "The sword-arm of the Church of Set. Where the parent clan corrupts for its own patient reasons, the antitribu corrupt as sacrament: temptation is their liturgy, and the Sabbat packs that host them mistake the practice for zeal. They do not plant agents the way Camarilla spies would; they make themselves so useful that packs keep them. The registry files each as a standing contract, not a person, because that is how they behave.\n\nTheir weakness is doctrine: an agent must eventually turn on the thing they serve. Several have eaten their own packs; two founded lines that did the same. This is not a flaw to exploit, it is a schedule.\n\nStanding directive: accept no contract, no gift, no favor; log every offer verbatim with the exact wording, note who witnessed it, and file under TAB-OPEN. A favor accepted from the Ministry is never free, and the interest is collected in things you did not know you owned.",
