      "lore_md": "SCHRECKNET DOSSIER: RAVNOS ANTITRIBU\n\nThe Ravnos antitribu took the clan gift for illusion and pointed it at survival instead of profit. Where clan Ravnos deceive to feed, the antitribu deceive to shield: their packs move through cities under canvas that cameras refuse to see, hold courts in venues that do not photograph, and keep censuses that outcount their own rosters.\n\nTheir Chimerstry serves the pack first. Illusions are doctrine, not display, and the bloodline treats a flawless deception as a sacrament. This makes them the Sabbat best at hiding and worst at holding: their packs dissolve when the show ends, and reassemble wherever a tent goes up.\n\nThey are dangerous to the network in one specific way: their illusions touch data. Phantom signatures, ghost appointments, census inflation, and photo returns all drift through SchreckNET traffic, and two of the operators who chased them recanted their own node names afterward.\n\nThe line between their illusions and the truth is thinner than any other bloodline file we hold. When a discrepancy in this dossier cannot be resolved, the resolution was staged.\n\nSTANDING DIRECTIVE: verify with two independent nodes before acting on any figure in this file; never accept an introduction from someone who names your node before you do; if a debt, a census, or a photograph in this file matches your own records too exactly, close the packet and report VLA-7, because a deception that knows your records is not performing for you.",
