      "weakness": "The clan obsession inverted: where the Toreador freezes before beauty, the antitribu freezes before atrocity, and it is always atrocity they find beautiful.",
      "lore_md": "SchreckNET DOSSIER — TOREADOR ANTITRIBU. The sword-branch of the Degenerates took the clan fixation and pointed it at the worst thing in the room. Where the main clan collects beauty, the antitribu curates damage: flayed portraits, war canvases, performances with body counts, gardens folded from confiscated ledgers. They are not mindless — that is the problem. Every file in this dossier describes a disciplined, patient, self-aware artist whose medium is suffering and whose career is long.\n\nThe registry files them as CURATORS. Their value to the Sabbat is morale and terror in equal measure; their value to the registry is that artists sign their work. Every antitribu leaves a recognizable signature — a frame, a fold, a measure, a seating order — and signatures are evidence. Cross-reference every unexplained atrocity scene against the signature index before attributing it to frenzy.\n\nThe main clan denies them at salon level and collects them at every other level. Several galleries listed in this dossier have Camarilla patrons on record. The registry does not comment on what that implies.\n\nSTANDING DIRECTIVE: attend nothing, bid on nothing, accept no gift larger than a hand. Their attention is the commission. Log every offer with the exact wording — the wording is the signature.",
