      "weakness": "The pyramid of blood bonds inverted: instead of being bound up the chain, the antitribu trade in bonds, buying and selling the obedience of others as inventory.",
      "lore_md": "SchreckNET DOSSIER — TREMERE ANTITRIBU. The sword-branch of the Usurpers did not leave the pyramid; they monetized it. Where the main clan hoards bonds, the antitribu trade them — bonds, hexes, rendered memories, printed spells — with paperwork. They are the only antitribu line the registry files as MERCHANTS first and THREAT second, because every one of their operations leaves an invoice, and invoices are evidence.\n\nHouse Goratrix gave them doctrine and deniability. The 2008 burning of the Vienna chantry scattered their stock across Europe; several entries in this dossier hold assets the SI believes were destroyed that night. The registry does not disabuse them.\n\nTheir signature is commercial: seals, ledgers, labels, catalogs. Seizures should be processed as financial evidence first and occult evidence second. The reversal has caught three SI forensic teams off guard.\n\nSTANDING DIRECTIVE: buy nothing, sample nothing, sign nothing. Their commerce is the trap. Log every offer verbatim, note the ink, and file under the seller’s class roll — the roll is how we find the school.",
